            "rationale": "The board is a read-heavy server-rendered page; invalidation belongs to the work-item/label mutation owners and must not permit cross-tenant leakage."
          },
          {
            "topic": "Testing",
            "choice": "Test policy with fake ports, adapters against capability contracts, and the complete flow with e2e",
            "rationale": "Each test crosses only the boundary it owns and verifies both independent capability behavior and board composition."
          }
        ],
        "risks": [
