            "purpose": "Work-item persistence adapter/module, returning domain-shaped work-item data."
          },
          {
            "path": "src/data/labels/index.ts",
            "purpose": "Label persistence adapter/module, returning domain-shaped label data."
          }

        ],
        "flows": [
          "GET/render /board: `src/app/board/page.tsx` -> `src/adapters/inbound/read/board/load-board.ts` -> verify server-derived actor/session -> `src/use-cases/board/entries/load-board.ts` -> `src/use-cases/board/operations/load-board.ts` -> `work-items.listBoardItems(actor, filters)` and `labels.listVisibleLabels(actor, referencedLabelIds)` -> board policy transformation -> validated board view model -> RSC renders `src/ui/board/BoardView.tsx`.",
          "Board operation flow: fetch actor-scoped work items, remove archived items, collect referenced label IDs, fetch labels through the labels public operation, reject with `forbidden` if any referenced label is not visible, attach visible label details, then group remaining items by status.",
          "Work-items flow: board operation -> published work-items operation -> `src/data/work-items/index.ts` -> work-item store/RLS. Labels follow the analogous path through `src/data/labels/index.ts`. Persistence and provider details remain inside their owning slices."
        ],
        "decisions": [
          {
            "topic": "Slice ownership",
            "choice": "Add a dedicated `board` capability slice.",
            "rationale": "The combined projection and policies belong to the board, not to work-items or labels; this avoids duplicating policy and preserves independent changeability."
          },
          {
            "topic": "Dependency direction",
            "choice": "Board may depend on published work-items and labels operations; work-items and labels must not depend on board or each other.",
